{
  "info": {
    "name": "Campus Lost & Found API",
    "description": "Campus Lost & Found backend uchun Postman collection.\n\n## Ishlatish\n\n1. Postman -> Import -> bu faylni tanlang.\n2. Serverni ishga tushiring: uvicorn app.main:app --reload\n3. `Auth / Register` -> `Auth / Login` ni yuboring. Login javobidagi token avtomatik `{{token}}` ga saqlanadi, qolgan so'rovlar shu token bilan ishlaydi.\n4. `Listings / Create listing` yuboring — yaratilgan e'lon id'si `{{listingId}}` ga saqlanadi va keyingi so'rovlar shu id bilan ishlaydi.\n\n## Variable'lar\n\n- `baseUrl` — http://localhost:8000/api/v1 (boshqa portda ishlatsangiz o'zgartiring)\n- `token` — Login avtomatik to'ldiradi, qo'lda tegmang\n- `listingId` — Create listing avtomatik to'ldiradi\n\n## Test'lar\n\nHar bir so'rovda status code tekshiruvi bor. Javob Postman'ning pastki qismidagi \"Test Results\" bo'limida ko'rinadi. Endpoint hali yozilmagan bo'lsa test qizil bo'ladi — bu normal, yozganingizdan keyin yashil bo'ladi.\n\n## Collection Runner\n\nBarcha so'rovlarni ketma-ket ishga tushirsangiz (Run collection), tartib to'g'ri ishlaydi: Register -> Login -> Create -> ... -> Delete.\n\nEslatma: `Delete listing` oxirida turadi va yaratilgan e'lonni o'chiradi. Shundan keyin `My listings` bo'sh ro'yxat qaytarishi normal.\n\nBatafsil: API.md",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "listingId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 201 (yoki 409 — email allaqachon band)\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([201, 409]);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    pm.test(\"Javobda id va email bor\", function () {",
                  "        const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "        pm.expect(data).to.have.property('id');",
                  "        pm.expect(data).to.have.property('email');",
                  "    });",
                  "",
                  "    pm.test(\"Javobda parol qaytmaydi\", function () {",
                  "        const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "        pm.expect(data).to.not.have.property('password');",
                  "        pm.expect(data).to.not.have.property('password_hash');",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"student@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"strong-password\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Yangi user yaratadi -> 201.\n\nShu email bilan ikkinchi marta yuborsangiz -> 409."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"access_token qaytdi\", function () {",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(data).to.have.property('access_token');",
                  "    pm.expect(data.access_token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Token'ni avtomatik saqlaydi — qolgan so'rovlar shundan foydalanadi",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', pm.response.json().access_token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"student@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"strong-password\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "access_token qaytaradi va uni avtomatik {{token}} ga saqlaydi.\n\nEmail yoki parol noto'g'ri bo'lsa -> 401."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — noto'g'ri parol (401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 401\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"student@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"wrong-password\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Bu so'rov 401 qaytarishi KERAK.\n\nAgar 200 qaytsa — parol tekshiruvida xato bor."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Current user",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Javobda email bor, parol yo'q\", function () {",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(data).to.have.property('email');",
                  "    pm.expect(data).to.not.have.property('password_hash');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Token egasining ma'lumoti.\n\nToken yo'q yoki yaroqsiz bo'lsa -> 401."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Listings",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create listing",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 201\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Status ACTIVE bo'lib yaratildi\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('ACTIVE');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Yaratilgan id'ni keyingi so'rovlar uchun saqlaydi",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('listingId', pm.response.json().id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"AirPods Pro\",\n  \"description\": \"Found near the library\",\n  \"type\": \"FOUND\",\n  \"date\": \"2026-05-20\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/listings",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["listings"]
            },
            "description": "Token talab qiladi.\n\n`user_id` request'dan olinmaydi — token'dagi userdan olinadi.\n`status` har doim ACTIVE bo'lib yaratiladi.\n\nYaratilgan id avtomatik {{listingId}} ga saqlanadi."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create listing — validation xatosi (422)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 422\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(422);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"A\",\n  \"description\": \"Too short title\",\n  \"type\": \"BROKEN\",\n  \"date\": \"not-a-date\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/listings",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["listings"]
            },
            "description": "Ataylab noto'g'ri ma'lumot: title juda qisqa, type mavjud emas, date noto'g'ri.\n\n422 qaytishi KERAK. Agar 201 qaytsa — Pydantic schema'da validation yo'q."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List listings",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Javobda items va total bor\", function () {",
                  "    const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(data).to.have.property('items');",
                  "    pm.expect(data.items).to.be.an('array');",
                  "    pm.expect(data).to.have.property('total');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/listings?page=1&page_size=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["listings"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1"
                },
                {
                  "key": "page_size",
                  "value": "20"
                },
                {
                  "key": "type",
                  "value": "FOUND",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Ochiq endpoint — token kerak emas.\n\n`type` parametrini yoqib ko'ring (checkbox'ni belgilang)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Search listings",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Topilgan e'lonlar title'ida 'airpods' bor\", function () {",
                  "    const items = pm.response.json().items;",
                  "    items.forEach(function (item) {",
                  "        pm.expect(item.title.toLowerCase()).to.include('airpods');",
                  "    });",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/listings?search=airpods",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["listings"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "search",
                  "value": "airpods"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Qidiruv faqat title bo'yicha, katta-kichik harf farqlanmaydi (ILIKE).\n\n'airpods' deb yozganda 'AirPods Pro' topilishi kerak."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
